    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d473">

                <pb facs="0560" n="464" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg464"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Baron Fava to Mr.
                            Hill.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Lenox, Mass.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-09-23"><hi rendition="#italic">September 23,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Thanks for your kind telegram of 21st instant. As soon as you know when grand
                    jury shall meet please wire me. You will also greatly oblige me by forwarding
                    me, if possible, copy of report of governor Louisiana with its inclosures.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Fava.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
